        "statement": "For $0<s<1$, $t=\\sqrt{1-s^2}$ and any real $\\theta$, form the four\nflagged states as above. Among all CPTP maps on $ET$ satisfying\n$\\Lambda\\tau_j=\\tau_j$ for $j=0,1$, the minimum of\n$D(\\Lambda\\eta_0,\\Lambda\\eta_1)$ is\n\\begin{equation}\n t|\\cos 2\\theta|.\n\\end{equation}\nThus exact erasure with exact preservation in this family is possible\nif and only if $\\cos 2\\theta=0$.",
